    rdfs:label "Document Publishing: published embargoed states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the published embargoed path of the Document Publishing workflow, in order: published, embargoed. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The publishing lifecycle of a document from the SPAR Publishing Status Ontology: draft, submission, review, acceptance or rejection, proof, publication, version of record, archive, with withdrawal, revision, embargo and retraction." ;
